WEBVTT

00:00:02.109 --> 00:00:05.279
Once, when many planets
intermingled and

00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:08.716
the boundary between man
and god was vague...

00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:14.221
There was a tale of a particular family.
A tale of love and rebirth.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:27.167
Sometimes I think things over.
It helps to cheer me up.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:37.678
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:00:40.848 --> 00:00:44.552
This place has always
meant everything to me.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.823
It rains so beautifully here.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:55.296
I can dance like the wind.

00:00:57.798 --> 00:01:00.801
Even now, I'm having fun.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.640
I have a better sense of
rhythm than you'd think.

00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:12.313
It felt as though every time
I heard a certain someone's voice,

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:22.723
I would think back to how
I grew up surrounded by laughter.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:28.796
Yes, anywhere would have
done as a place to call home.

00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:34.301
Farewell, sunshine!
The night rises up invitingly.

00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:39.573
It's okay, this world moves
in a way that will connect us.

00:01:39.807 --> 00:01:46.280
So that we can all smile
together once again.

00:02:03.964 --> 00:02:05.799
Sensei, how are you?

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.168
I'm sorry for vanishing so suddenly.

00:02:08.535 --> 00:02:09.737
Are you worried?

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:13.507
You stupid piece of crap! Die!

00:02:13.807 --> 00:02:14.875
Right now, I'm...

00:02:15.142 --> 00:02:18.012
What Came was a Little Sister
...in the Looking Glass City.

00:02:38.565 --> 00:02:40.034
Chapter 4: The Past (3)/ Teacher
and Student at the Shrine A

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:42.036
I'll be back.

00:02:42.736 --> 00:02:43.170
Okay.

00:02:44.038 --> 00:02:46.040
You look so gloomy!

00:02:46.273 --> 00:02:49.443
What a sad little baby you are.

00:02:49.777 --> 00:02:50.444
Hey, now.

00:02:51.311 --> 00:02:52.413
Central Line Unified Organization

00:02:52.413 --> 00:02:53.313
The Shrine

00:02:54.014 --> 00:02:55.516
| don't think I'll be long.

00:02:55.783 --> 00:02:56.316
Okay.

00:02:57.584 --> 00:02:58.185
Thank you.

00:02:59.086 --> 00:03:00.954
Watch the place while I'm gone, okay?

00:03:00.954 --> 00:03:01.388
Okay.

00:03:01.889 --> 00:03:04.358
Tell the priests if
something happens, okay?

00:03:04.992 --> 00:03:05.426
Okay.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:07.828
What else...

00:03:07.828 --> 00:03:10.831
Keep count of how many
times you cry, crybaby!

00:03:11.198 --> 00:03:14.101
Inari won't be around
to save you, wimp!

00:03:18.772 --> 00:03:20.641
Stop it, you two.

00:03:25.512 --> 00:03:28.082
Familiars aren't capable of ill-will.

00:03:28.816 --> 00:03:30.718
Don't worry about what they say.

00:03:32.086 --> 00:03:34.121
You're a member of the Shrine now.

00:03:34.488 --> 00:03:35.689
Act like it.

00:03:36.256 --> 00:03:40.461
Planetary Unified Organization The Shrine Keep
your head held high, no matter what they say.

00:03:42.629 --> 00:03:44.131
Okay, Sensei.

00:03:44.131 --> 00:03:44.665
Good.

00:03:45.699 --> 00:03:49.236
So the child the Fox took
in is one of us now?

00:03:49.703 --> 00:03:51.238
How impudent.

00:03:51.805 --> 00:03:53.474
It's a disgrace.

00:03:53.674 --> 00:03:56.243
| have no idea what the Fox is thinking.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.813
Who knows if that child
is a human or a monster...

00:04:00.414 --> 00:04:01.749
Those red eyes...

00:04:10.257 --> 00:04:11.992
Don't skip your training.

00:04:13.827 --> 00:04:16.563
Get stronger and face them head-on.

00:04:17.631 --> 00:04:22.069
I'm sure that's what your
mom would say, Koto.

00:04:22.402 --> 00:04:25.038
Just do the best you can, shrimp!

00:04:25.439 --> 00:04:27.608
We'll play with you when we get back.

00:04:33.647 --> 00:04:34.948
Bye!

00:04:52.866 --> 00:04:55.169
Shouldn't we stop Koto-chan?

00:04:55.435 --> 00:04:55.936
Hm?

00:04:56.436 --> 00:04:57.037
Yeah.

00:04:57.704 --> 00:04:58.272
Koto!

00:04:58.972 --> 00:05:01.708
Keep your arms closer to
your body when you punch.

00:05:01.708 --> 00:05:02.342
Right!

00:05:06.847 --> 00:05:09.316
There's something wrong with
that student and her teacher!

00:05:09.316 --> 00:05:12.653
These acts are not worthy of one
who would wear the fox mask!

00:05:12.886 --> 00:05:15.255
High Priest, I beg you to
address this problem directly...

00:05:15.422 --> 00:05:16.623
Inari! Koto!

00:05:17.624 --> 00:05:19.493
You heard him, yes?

00:05:19.493 --> 00:05:22.629
Yes! I think it's their fault for
messing around during training.

00:05:23.297 --> 00:05:25.732
And for not apologizing.

00:05:26.166 --> 00:05:27.334
And for being weak.

00:05:28.735 --> 00:05:31.738
| think it's stress that's
made you so grouchy.

00:05:32.673 --> 00:05:34.508
Why not take a vacation?

00:05:35.275 --> 00:05:38.612
I'll take care of your
students while you're gone.

00:05:38.812 --> 00:05:39.479
What?!

00:05:39.913 --> 00:05:41.081
No! No! No! No!

00:05:41.448 --> 00:05:43.483
| don't want you to do that, Sensei!

00:05:43.817 --> 00:05:46.086
But this teacher is having doubts

00:05:46.086 --> 00:05:48.322
No! No! No! No!
about his teaching methods.

00:05:48.322 --> 00:05:49.923
Somebody needs to help him.

00:05:49.923 --> 00:05:51.024
This isn't about me!

00:05:51.024 --> 00:05:53.026
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:05:53.026 --> 00:05:54.494
Chapter S: The Past (4)/ Teacher
and Student at the Shrine B

00:05:54.795 --> 00:05:56.063
Good morning, Koto.

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:57.531
Good morning!

00:06:00.667 --> 00:06:02.269
| have a secret.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.966
You fell asleep with your mask on again!

00:06:33.901 --> 00:06:34.768
You're weird.

00:06:35.369 --> 00:06:36.603
Koto!

00:06:37.938 --> 00:06:39.139
Good morning!

00:06:43.877 --> 00:06:45.846
Good morning, little tomboy.

00:06:47.047 --> 00:06:48.982
This place is too big, Sensei.

00:06:49.249 --> 00:06:51.184
It's nice to have so many rooms, isn't it?

00:07:04.064 --> 00:07:04.965
Yuck.

00:07:05.299 --> 00:07:10.504
Would you like a report on the
toxins found in burnt bread?

00:07:10.671 --> 00:07:12.406
Don't force yourselves...

00:07:12.572 --> 00:07:14.675
What's your problem, guys?

00:07:15.609 --> 00:07:19.379
Work is really all you
can do, isn't it, Sensei?

00:07:19.579 --> 00:07:20.814
Hey, that hurt.

00:07:21.281 --> 00:07:23.550
Maybe I'll make it again.

00:07:24.384 --> 00:07:25.385
Not a chance.

00:07:30.057 --> 00:07:32.659
If it's bitter, then add some sugar!

00:07:32.859 --> 00:07:34.561
That's disgusting!

00:07:38.665 --> 00:07:40.400
What class are you teaching today?

00:07:41.368 --> 00:07:43.070
Aide to the inspection team.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.237
Aide?

00:07:44.538 --> 00:07:45.772
You?

00:07:46.139 --> 00:07:48.775
What? What's wrong
with being an aide?

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.045
What time's the connection?

00:07:52.045 --> 00:07:55.649
Nine? I think?

00:07:56.984 --> 00:07:57.451
Seven hours
Time you're at school

00:07:59.219 --> 00:08:02.489
You're going too fast, Koto!

00:08:10.163 --> 00:08:12.265
Might not be back 'til tomorrow!

00:08:12.265 --> 00:08:13.767
Hurry up, Fox!

00:08:14.368 --> 00:08:16.937
Good... bye...

00:08:17.604 --> 00:08:18.271
Koto!

00:08:19.006 --> 00:08:20.440
| knew I'd find you here.

00:08:21.274 --> 00:08:23.143
I've been looking everywhere for you.

00:08:23.377 --> 00:08:24.644
Katsura-chan?

00:08:24.644 --> 00:08:27.981
From the look on your face...
did you forget?

00:08:29.649 --> 00:08:30.617
My exam?

00:08:30.951 --> 00:08:31.785
Yup!

00:08:32.052 --> 00:08:34.554
I'm sorry! I forgot!
| forgot! I'm sorry!

00:08:34.821 --> 00:08:36.156
<i>'M sorry!</i>

00:08:36.156 --> 00:08:36.857
Koto...

00:08:37.624 --> 00:08:39.226
| have a secret.

00:08:47.667 --> 00:08:50.404
So Inari's spending the
whole day babysitting?

00:08:50.837 --> 00:08:51.972
What a waste.

00:08:52.639 --> 00:08:56.943
There are plenty of other things we
could have a top squad member doing.

00:08:57.511 --> 00:09:00.680
The High Priest has to be careful
when he's dealing with the old families.

00:09:03.517 --> 00:09:07.120
Hey, so I heard you got in a
fight with a noble brat again?

00:09:08.455 --> 00:09:11.391
It wasn't a fight. I destroyed him.

00:09:13.627 --> 00:09:15.295
- Hey!
- Good work, Koto!

00:09:15.295 --> 00:09:18.365
Keep it up just like that!

00:09:22.069 --> 00:09:22.836
Idiot.

00:09:23.036 --> 00:09:24.237
Idiot.

00:09:24.237 --> 00:09:25.639
That hurt!

00:09:25.639 --> 00:09:27.507
My visual stream got messed up!

00:09:27.507 --> 00:09:28.642
Were you trying to kill me?

00:09:28.642 --> 00:09:30.544
You can't die, Ichijouji.

00:09:30.744 --> 00:09:32.345
That's not the issue—

00:09:32.612 --> 00:09:33.513
Too close!

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.718
What if I lost data?

00:09:38.718 --> 00:09:40.687
Not like there's anything
left worth losing.

00:09:40.687 --> 00:09:42.222
What does that mean?

00:09:42.456 --> 00:09:43.423
She's got a point.

00:09:43.557 --> 00:09:44.124
Huh?!

00:09:44.124 --> 00:09:46.259
- Why not have someone look at that?
- Katsura!

00:09:46.493 --> 00:09:47.961
Nyah!

00:09:47.961 --> 00:09:49.162
Koto!

00:09:51.131 --> 00:09:53.633
Good to see you're all so friendly.

00:09:53.867 --> 00:09:54.634
High Priest!

00:09:55.135 --> 00:09:58.105
| propose that Koto be deployed
into battle immediately.

00:09:58.105 --> 00:10:00.273
| just took two hard hits.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.241
Oh?

00:10:01.508 --> 00:10:03.443
Ichijouiji is just weak!

00:10:03.443 --> 00:10:04.244
You little...

00:10:04.544 --> 00:10:05.245
Is he?

00:10:12.652 --> 00:10:15.188
I've got high hopes for you,
student of the Fox.

00:10:15.789 --> 00:10:16.723
Right!

00:10:17.557 --> 00:10:19.960
It's good to see that you're strong,

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.396
but it's not good to neglect your studies.

00:10:25.432 --> 00:10:28.135
And, you guys,
don't spoil her too much.

00:10:28.568 --> 00:10:29.603
I'm not.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.438
It's too late for that!

00:10:31.838 --> 00:10:35.675
When Koto skips class,
I get the complaints...

00:10:36.576 --> 00:10:37.677
You, too.

00:10:38.512 --> 00:10:40.514
You're just not getting used to school.

00:10:45.118 --> 00:10:46.853
And so, as you can see,

00:10:46.853 --> 00:10:51.458
the Shrine is responsible for
maintaining order in this world,

00:10:51.858 --> 00:10:56.029
and its families have tended to
this task with pride for centuries...

00:10:59.633 --> 00:11:00.834
33: Yuuta Sakaki 34:
Midori Kaihara 35: Koto Koto!

00:11:01.268 --> 00:11:01.868
Koto!

00:11:21.655 --> 00:11:22.422
Neko (Cat).

00:11:22.756 --> 00:11:23.690
Koshou (Pepper).

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:24.558
Unko (Poop).

00:11:24.558 --> 00:11:26.259
"Ko" again?

00:11:26.526 --> 00:11:30.030
This is it for you!

00:11:31.698 --> 00:11:34.167
| thought you ran away, Koto.

00:11:36.102 --> 00:11:37.771
Hachiman...

00:11:37.971 --> 00:11:39.839
Today I will defeat you!

00:11:40.006 --> 00:11:41.575
You said that yesterday.

00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:42.375
Shut up!

00:11:42.576 --> 00:11:43.443
Let's fight!

00:11:44.911 --> 00:11:48.815
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:11:49.583 --> 00:11:50.417
Okay, come on!

00:11:50.617 --> 00:11:52.085
Are you messing with me?

00:11:52.352 --> 00:11:54.321
This is all I have right now!

00:11:54.554 --> 00:11:56.423
You think you can beat me with that?

00:11:56.756 --> 00:11:57.224
Yes.

00:12:00.527 --> 00:12:02.095
Attack!

00:12:03.797 --> 00:12:04.798
One more try.

00:12:05.799 --> 00:12:06.933
One more try!

00:12:08.134 --> 00:12:09.569
One more try!

00:12:11.571 --> 00:12:13.807
One... more... try.

00:12:14.774 --> 00:12:16.109
That's enough!

00:12:20.647 --> 00:12:21.881
Okay, we're done.

00:12:25.485 --> 00:12:27.220
Kill me if you must!

00:12:27.487 --> 00:12:28.521
No.

00:12:28.755 --> 00:12:30.223
Damn it!

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:32.225
You never learn.

00:12:32.225 --> 00:12:33.193
Shut up!

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:37.130
A man of the Hachiman
family can't keep losing!

00:12:37.497 --> 00:12:39.766
At this rate, my family's
honor will be destroyed.

00:12:40.834 --> 00:12:42.636
Must be hard to be a noble.

00:12:42.636 --> 00:12:43.470
Shut up!

00:12:44.504 --> 00:12:45.839
Don't cry.

00:12:46.706 --> 00:12:49.509
You used to cry all the time!

00:12:52.178 --> 00:12:53.947
You got strong all of a sudden.

00:12:54.648 --> 00:12:55.782
What's with you?

00:13:01.788 --> 00:13:03.757
Why bring that up now, Hachiman?

00:13:04.658 --> 00:13:06.159
You know what everybody says.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.762
That the Fox took me in.

00:13:13.233 --> 00:13:13.700
Hey.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.903
Well, good luck with your family!

00:13:16.903 --> 00:13:17.604
Hey!

00:13:18.271 --> 00:13:20.373
That's not what I meant.

00:13:22.208 --> 00:13:25.312
And tomorrow, I'm going to win.

00:13:25.312 --> 00:13:26.613
Right, right.

00:13:35.121 --> 00:13:36.456
Welcome back, Koto.

00:13:36.956 --> 00:13:38.224
I'm back!

00:14:07.287 --> 00:14:08.154
Here it is!

00:14:33.646 --> 00:14:36.449
Koto

00:14:58.938 --> 00:14:59.939
Mom...

00:16:27.293 --> 00:16:28.528
Sensei...

00:16:43.076 --> 00:16:46.145
Sensei! Sensei!

00:16:49.616 --> 00:16:52.519
Koto

00:17:19.245 --> 00:17:20.079
Koto...

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:44.437
Koto

00:17:46.739 --> 00:17:47.574
Koto?

00:18:26.079 --> 00:18:28.381
| have a secret.

00:18:34.387 --> 00:18:35.855
Welcome back!

00:18:36.289 --> 00:18:37.323
I'm back.

00:18:37.724 --> 00:18:38.992
When did you get back?

00:18:39.559 --> 00:18:40.526
Just now.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:41.861
What about you?

00:18:41.861 --> 00:18:42.562
Just now!

00:18:46.265 --> 00:18:46.833
What?

00:18:48.668 --> 00:18:50.570
| thought you were asleep.

00:18:50.803 --> 00:18:51.671
| was awake!

00:18:59.178 --> 00:19:00.046
What?

00:19:03.316 --> 00:19:04.150
Koto?

00:19:07.787 --> 00:19:09.355
Did you cry today, Dad?

00:19:09.756 --> 00:19:10.123
Huh?

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:13.393
We have a secret!

00:19:15.728 --> 00:19:19.165
Still she haunts me, phantomwise,
Alice moving under skies,

00:19:19.399 --> 00:19:21.901
Never seen by waking eyes.

00:19:23.236 --> 00:19:26.806
Children yet, the tale to hear,

00:19:27.006 --> 00:19:30.209
Eager eye and willing ear,

00:19:30.543 --> 00:19:32.545
Lovingly shall nestle near.

00:19:33.713 --> 00:19:36.015
In a Wonderland they lie,

00:19:36.582 --> 00:19:38.685
Dreaming as the days go by.

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:44.691
Good morning.

00:19:45.058 --> 00:19:47.760
You're mumbling again.

00:19:48.094 --> 00:19:49.996
What do you mean, mumbling?

00:19:50.963 --> 00:19:54.167
You were thinking about the
Looking Glass City again, huh?

00:19:59.338 --> 00:20:01.140
| couldn't say.

00:20:02.241 --> 00:20:03.109
Liar.

00:20:03.509 --> 00:20:05.044
| know!

00:20:10.316 --> 00:20:10.950
Ow!

00:20:11.951 --> 00:20:14.353
That was a good kick.
You put your weight into it.

00:20:14.754 --> 00:20:18.091
| suppose I should praise
you for training hard.

00:20:18.558 --> 00:20:22.295
Of course! I'm going to be
number one at the Shrine!

00:20:23.529 --> 00:20:26.199
The crybaby I knew sure has grown up.

00:20:26.899 --> 00:20:29.001
As a teacher, I'm very proud.

00:20:31.137 --> 00:20:33.272
| might end up being stronger than you.

00:20:33.973 --> 00:20:36.375
| guess you'll be the teacher, then!

00:20:46.686 --> 00:20:49.188
| want to go find Mom.

00:20:49.922 --> 00:20:50.523
Yeah.

00:20:51.023 --> 00:20:52.759
| want to meet her and talk to her.

00:20:52.959 --> 00:20:53.426
Yeah.

00:20:54.026 --> 00:20:55.528
| hope she's pretty.

00:20:56.162 --> 00:20:56.729
Yeah.

00:20:57.096 --> 00:20:58.431
I'm sure she'll be surprised.

00:20:58.898 --> 00:20:59.398
Yeah.

00:20:59.732 --> 00:21:01.267
| want to ask about you, too, Dad!

00:21:02.168 --> 00:21:02.668
Yeah.

00:21:03.236 --> 00:21:05.938
You know the truth, don't you, Dad?

00:21:07.073 --> 00:21:07.607
Yeah.

00:21:10.076 --> 00:21:13.846
Koto, I know you'll reach it someday...

00:21:14.714 --> 00:21:17.583
The place where summers die
and are forever reborn.

00:21:18.351 --> 00:21:19.952
The forgotten paradise.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:22.688
The country through the looking glass,

00:21:22.688 --> 00:21:24.924
where the gravestones of
memories stand in rows.

00:21:26.092 --> 00:21:26.959
| know you will.

00:21:32.031 --> 00:21:34.033
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:21:34.033 --> 00:21:35.501
Chapter 6: The Present
(2)/ The Council of Three

00:21:39.739 --> 00:21:42.408
| was wondering why you
bothered to show up for once.

00:21:42.408 --> 00:21:44.210
Look at your face.

00:21:45.311 --> 00:21:47.480
Things seem to be going well.

00:21:48.114 --> 00:21:50.449
I've been sent a trio of evil spirits.

00:21:50.716 --> 00:21:51.684
They're haunting me.

00:21:52.618 --> 00:21:53.920
Sorry to hear that!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.422
...guess I should say.

00:21:56.656 --> 00:22:00.126
What's the problem?
They seem to like him.

00:22:01.027 --> 00:22:02.028
I'm jealous.

00:22:02.361 --> 00:22:05.298
You can have the rights to the
cake plate any time you want it.

00:22:05.298 --> 00:22:05.932
Hmph!

00:22:07.633 --> 00:22:08.968
Don't be like that.

00:22:08.968 --> 00:22:12.238
Our decisions here are absolute, correct?

00:22:12.238 --> 00:22:13.739
- Right, right.
- I know that.

00:22:14.807 --> 00:22:17.944
That girl is quite a handful, though.

00:22:19.245 --> 00:22:21.147
More like three handfuls!

00:22:21.581 --> 00:22:23.983
| like her! She's a tomboy!

00:22:24.617 --> 00:22:25.384
And so cute.

00:22:25.685 --> 00:22:26.953
| have high hopes for her.

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:29.355
The same name! The red eyes!

00:22:29.589 --> 00:22:31.457
Do you mean to say it's her?

00:22:31.991 --> 00:22:33.226
| don't know.

00:22:33.226 --> 00:22:34.427
You're scared.

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:37.296
You've always been a crybaby.

00:22:37.296 --> 00:22:40.166
Unlike you, I've grown
out of my kid clothes.

00:22:40.366 --> 00:22:43.302
Yet you need help getting into
the adult clothes you wear?

00:22:43.302 --> 00:22:44.837
Don't worry.

00:22:45.238 --> 00:22:48.941
You're both equally little boys.

00:22:50.843 --> 00:22:54.480
Anyway, that doesn't change
the fact that she's special.

00:22:54.847 --> 00:22:56.649
Our first guest since they've left,

00:22:56.649 --> 00:22:59.418
when we thought none would come!
We should be welcoming!

00:23:01.454 --> 00:23:05.224
Then let us swear to the
"first," my siblings.

00:23:06.225 --> 00:23:09.195
That between us, the "next three"...

00:23:09.629 --> 00:23:10.863
...there be honor...

00:23:10.863 --> 00:23:12.164
...and no secrets.

00:23:13.032 --> 00:23:16.369
To obey the
Ten Bloodless Commandments,

00:23:16.802 --> 00:23:19.405
in our name, and the name
of our great mother!

00:23:34.553 --> 00:23:36.088
I'm here, Dad!

00:23:47.266 --> 00:23:53.673
I'd even cut things off, (Ouch!)
to prove the fact I exist.

00:23:55.508 --> 00:24:01.614
Though eternal lies surround me,
they're my safety line.

00:24:03.416 --> 00:24:10.022
"Wanna take you high?"
The galaxy shakes. You smile.

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:18.064
I want to touch you. I don't want
to hear that it's forbidden.

00:24:19.865 --> 00:24:23.536
Moved to emotion by arguments,
| cast aside reason.

00:24:23.536 --> 00:24:28.641
I enter a game of risk that's
devoid of reason.

00:24:31.911 --> 00:24:36.682
It's resplendent with rare pain.

00:24:40.119 --> 00:24:45.191
Mistaking the real for the unreal.

00:24:48.327 --> 00:24:52.231
It transcends all understanding.

00:24:52.231 --> 00:24:53.165
So, fight!

00:24:56.435 --> 00:24:57.303
So, fight!

00:25:00.539 --> 00:25:01.374
So, fight!

00:25:08.581 --> 00:25:09.482
So, fight!

00:25:10.049 --> 00:25:12.018
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:25:13.452 --> 00:25:15.287
When my mother and father vanished,

00:25:16.055 --> 00:25:17.490
| didn't cry.

00:25:18.824 --> 00:25:21.394
Though my little brother and
sister cried a lot...

00:25:22.795 --> 00:25:25.598
| had a goal: to go to the outside world.

00:25:26.966 --> 00:25:29.168
To see what I was really worth.

00:25:29.802 --> 00:25:34.507
E Bldlest arnd s Erppy Sclanes Team Next
time: "The Eldest and His Happy Science Team."

00:25:34.707 --> 00:25:37.877
The story began on that day.
